dev/glassworks/voice/MicroFrontend.kt is a Kotlin port of
- TensorFlow Lite Micro's audio microfrontend (tensorflow/lite/experimental/microfrontend/lib:
  window, fft, filterbank, noise_reduction, pcan_gain_control, log_scale, log_lut).
  Copyright 2018 The TensorFlow Authors. Apache License 2.0 (META-INF/dev.glassworks/voice/LICENSE-APACHE-2.0).
  https://github.com/tensorflow/tflite-micro
- the 16-bit fixed-point real FFT it uses (kissfft kiss_fft.c and kiss_fftr.c).
  Copyright (c) 2003-2010 Mark Borgerding. BSD 3-Clause licence (META-INF/dev.glassworks/voice/LICENSE-BSD-3-CLAUSE).
  https://github.com/mborgerding/kissfft

Ported from the copies in rhasspy/pymicro-features v2.0.2 (commit
96bd69cfad79aa67697e176570d3dd87052c3def). Changes: rewritten in Kotlin for one fixed configuration
(microWakeWord's), with C's unsigned and 16-bit wrapping arithmetic spelled out. The file stays under
Apache-2.0 and BSD-3-Clause.
